1
00:00:00,517 --> 00:00:02,227
(Penny:)I know.

2
00:00:03,603 --> 00:00:08,603
(Sheldon:)Although I've always hated
how my right frontal lobe looks in pictures.

3
00:00:08,775 --> 00:00:10,315
(Beverley:)Common complaint among men.

4
00:00:10,485 --> 00:00:12,575
(Beverley:)Nothing's ever big enough.

5
00:00:13,071 --> 00:00:16,571
Except when they get a tumor.
Then you never hear the end of it.

6
00:00:17,826 --> 00:00:20,786
Yeah, I'd love to see
a scan of your brain sometime.

7
00:00:20,954 --> 00:00:24,244
(Beverley:)Oh, I'll send you a link,
but its physiology is fairly unimpressive.

8
00:00:24,416 --> 00:00:26,246
(Sheldon:)Oh, I can't believe that.

9
00:00:26,418 --> 00:00:31,168
(Beverley:)Your unwillingness to accept empirical
evidence suggests an attempt at flattery.

10
00:00:32,841 --> 00:00:34,301
(Sheldon:)My apologies.

11
00:00:34,467 --> 00:00:38,347
(Sheldon:)I've been living with your son too long.
Gotten into some bad habits.

12
00:00:38,763 --> 00:00:40,143
(Sheldon:)Understandable.

13
00:00:40,682 --> 00:00:42,512
(Sheldon:)Can I make you a cup of tea?

14
00:00:42,684 --> 00:00:46,474
(Beverley:)I doubt it, but if anyone has a chance,
it's probably you.

15
00:00:50,066 --> 00:00:52,446
(Sheldon:)I feel very comfortable around you.

16
00:00:53,778 --> 00:00:55,948
(Beverley:)I feel very comfortable around you too.

17
00:00:56,114 --> 00:01:00,284
(Sheldon:)It's surprising because I generally
don't feel comfortable around...

